OL,5,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FA nurse is potentially paralysed
OL,7,     Ffollowing a car crash; a
OL,8,     F23-year-old fights for his life,
OL,9,     Fstruggling to breathe; and a man
OL,10,     Ffaces life-threatening surgery to
OL,11,     Fremove a head tumour.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FDoctors have minutes to save a
OL,14,     Fman's sight in East London after a
OL,15,     Fviolent attack, while in Belfast
OL,16,     Furgent tests assess an elderly
OL,17,     Ffarmer with suspected
OL,18,     Flife-threatening abdominal pain.
