OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Natalia Spierings struggles to
OL,7,     Fsee acne hidden with makeup by a
OL,8,     Fpatient. Dr Toby Nelson is shocked
OL,9,     Fby a patient's DIY attempt on a
OL,10,     Fcyst. Dr Adil Sheraz tackles a
OL,11,     Fstubborn lipoma.
OL,12,G0000 The Surgeon
OL,13,     FSurgeons as you've never seen them
OL,14,     Fbefore. Now we go behind the mask
OL,15,     Fto reveal what life is really like
OL,16,     F- from the high-pressure world of
OL,17,     Fthe operating theatre to life back
OL,18,     Fhome. (Ep1/4)
